                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Sundry has a full personality, memory, and will of its own. It is not a haunt, is not running a loop, and can't be commanded, turned, or bound. Effects that target a construct's programming or a spirit's anchor have no effect on it. It will, however, talk.</p>"
